# Trivy Vulnerability Ignore Policy

Last Updated: 2026-04-10 | Review Date: 2026-05-10

**Policy**: OS-level CVEs (container context) + Application CVEs (non-critical)

**NOTE**: CRITICAL/HIGH app CVEs are NOT listed here - they MUST be fixed

---

## CATEGORY 1: OS-LEVEL CVEs (Base Image - Non-Exploitable in Container)

Justification: LOW severity CVEs in base Python image not exploitable in containerized non-root context. Container runs without shell access.

### glibc CVEs

CVE-2010-4756
CVE-2013-4392
CVE-2019-1010022
CVE-2019-1010023
CVE-2019-1010024
CVE-2019-1010025
CVE-2021-3999

